@title Cabinet plate: unavailable EMC chips say n/a, hot-spot badges stay apart
@area Cabinet
# EMC view on the plate: a chip with nothing to show reads "n/a" instead of looking switched off, and the numbered hot-spot badges neither overlap nor sit on another spot's point.
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text open emc example
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc view on the plate
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
expect "Indicative model"
expect "n/a"
shot plate-emc-spots
check_layout
